2026-07-27T11:49:42.2029312Z i /tmp/RtmpcXKlJy/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:49:42.2029633Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:49:42.2030304Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:49:42.2030712Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:49:42.2031197Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:49:42.2031920Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:49:42.2032808Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
